        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5057A, Aireon Lever with Modern Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Aireon Lever with Modern Round Rosette is a great choice for transitional and contemporary homes. The modern curve of the Aireon lever not only adds a contemporary sleek look, it fits nicely in the hand. A Emtek made leverset, it is both chic and streamlined. It is available in an array of modern finishes. It will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Aireon Door Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Aireon Leverset with Modern Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5057A-finish.jpg?v=1704442285\" width=\"514\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n<b>**Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/emtek-leversets\">Emtek Door Levers</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Aireon Lever with Modern Round Rosette",
                "description": "The Aireon Lever with Modern Round Rosette is a great choice for transitional and contemporary homes. The modern curve of the Aireon lever not only adds a contemporary sleek look, it fits nicely in the hand. A Emtek made leverset, it is both chic and streamlined. It is available in an array of modern finishes. It will fit doors with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit doors 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick.",
